In article <1994Jan31.195045.833@mnemosyne.cs.du.edu>, jyanek@nyx10.cs.du.edu (Jay Yanek) writes:
>Can altars be converted to your alignment/god?  I'm not looking for
>specifics, but a few minor nudges in the right direction would be
>helpful.

Yes you can.

Here's a minor nudge:
  There are only four (?) useful things you can do with altars.
  - Drop things on them.
  - Pray while standing on them.
  - #offer a corpse on them.
  - kick them.

Assuming those are all the things you can do with altars, then some 
combination of them done in the correct sequence at the correct time
would convert it (or has a chance of converting it).
